++++++++   applies `fork/patches/*.patch` with `git apply --index --3way`. The result is
++++++++   one commit per sync, carrying an `Upstream-Commit: <sha>` trailer. Nothing is
++++++++   ever rebased by hand, so there are no merge commits to resolve.
